WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.258
Day 7. Words with five sounds.

2
00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:09.520
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:15.193
Today the words are longer. Two sounds side by side at the start, and two at the end.

4
00:00:20.618 --> 00:00:21.641
The word is stamp.

5
00:00:27.312 --> 00:00:28.416
The word is crisp.

6
00:00:29.316 --> 00:00:33.872
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

7
00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:38.846
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

8
00:00:39.296 --> 00:00:43.328
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

9
00:00:43.778 --> 00:00:46.666
Two letters, two sounds. Say each one. Then wait.

10
00:00:47.466 --> 00:00:53.039
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

11
00:00:53.489 --> 00:00:56.951
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
